00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:56.539
bankers fees and stores closing. Yeah. Yeah.

00:00:56.539 --> 00:01:00.499
So listen, it's a very good question, which
is retail has been such an important sector

00:01:00.499 --> 00:01:05.080
in the American economy for decades. How is
it that the economy you can supposedly be

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:09.030
doing so well if so many retail stores are
closing? And the answer is that the economy

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:13.970
