00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:29.110
the economy in and of itself has been moving
away from retail for a long time and that

00:01:29.110 --> 00:01:35.360
there is going to be at a certain point in
time, retail is simply not going to be as

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:42.210
important a, um, uh, a a vertical and industry
